{"id":"olor","lemma":"olor","pos":"noun","rank":1343,"glosses":["smell, scent, odor","whiff (i.e. hint)"],"ipa":"/oˈloɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"olores"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-olor.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué es ese olor?","en":"What's that smell?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449184"},{"text":"No me gustan los bares. Son caros, ruidosos y llenos de olores a tabaco y fritanga.","en":"I don't like snack bars. They're expensive, noisy, and full of the smell of tobacco and fried food."},{"text":"El olor era espantoso.","en":"The smell was horrible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77975"},{"text":"El olor era desagradable.","en":"The smell was offensive.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705453"},{"text":"No me importa el olor.","en":"I don't mind the smell.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630047"}]}